<!--
    Custom original design: a prohibition sign styled after the Indonesian
    "Dilarang Masuk" sign - a ring with one continuous diagonal bar running
    edge to edge (upper-left to lower-right), crossing the big horizontal
    "AI" letters; styled like the other home menu icons (see
    ic_photo_restore_black). The bar passes over the letters: where it
    crosses, the letters are knocked out of the bar (except the counter of
    the A, which stays bar-colored like a real hole), while the letter
    parts outside the bar are drawn dark - so letter and bar both stay
    visible on any background. Ring, bar and letters are separate paths
    with opposite winding (plus fillType evenOdd) so the render is
    identical on all API levels (fillType is ignored below API 24).
-->
